name: sim.createOctree
description: Creates an empty OC tree
luaSynopsis: int handle = sim.createOctree(float voxelSize, int options, float pointSize)
pythonSynopsis: int handle = sim.createOctree(float voxelSize, int options, float pointSize)
inputs:
1. voxelSize: size of the voxels
2. options: bit-coded:
    - bit0 set (1): voxels have random colors
    - bit1 set (2): show OC tree structure
    - bit2 set (4): show points instead of voxels
    - bit3 set (8): reserved. keep unset
    - bit4 set (16): color is emissive
3. pointSize: the size of the points in pixels, when voxels are rendered with points
outputs:
1. handle: handle of the OC tree
